@startuml
title Buffer Ownership

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam rectangle {
  RoundCorner 18
}

rectangle "Rust Core" as Rust {
  rectangle "EditorBuffer" as Buffer
  rectangle "Undo/Redo" as History
  rectangle "Viewport Query" as Viewport
}

rectangle "Flutter Shell" as Flutter {
  rectangle "Keyboard + Pointer Input" as Input
  rectangle "Paragraph Cache" as Cache
  rectangle "CustomPainter" as Paint
}

rectangle "Wasm Plugin Host" as PluginHost {
  rectangle "Snapshot Request" as Snapshot
  rectangle "Edit Proposal" as Proposal
}

Input --> Buffer : commands only
Buffer --> History : inverse ops
Buffer --> Viewport : visible lines
Viewport --> Paint : view model
Cache --> Paint : cached layout
Snapshot --> Buffer : read-only slice
Proposal --> Buffer : validate + apply

note bottom of Buffer
Only Rust mutates the buffer.
Flutter and plugins observe or propose.
end note

@enduml
